  "pre_stated_hypothesis": "GMD_t = rolling Gini Mean Difference of qvol[t-W+1..t], W=48: GMD_t = (1/(n*(n-1))) * sum_{i!=j} |qvol_i - qvol_j| = (2/(n*(n-1))) * sum_k (2*k - n + 1) * x_sorted[k] (mean pairwise absolute difference, L1 dispersion using ALL in-window observations). g_z=zscore(GMD_t,ZLB=168). Mean-revert pairwise-dispersion shocks: g_z>=1.25 SHORT (abnormally wide pairwise dispersion; fade), g_z<=-1.25 LONG (abnormally narrow pairwise dispersion; fade), exit |g_z|<0.25 or hold>=12 or flip. Exec t->t+1. WF 720/168/168. Cost grid 0-40bps. Edge iff exposure>0 AND all slices OOS net>0 AND >B&H. Genuinely different from C23/C40-C62.",
  "hypothesis_differs_from_c23_c40_c62": "C63=rolling Gini Mean Difference (mean pairwise |x_i-x_j|, L1 dispersion using ALL in-window observations, two-sample U-statistic). C62=rolling IQR (Q3-Q1), rank/order-statistic dispersion of the middle 50% using two quartile cutpoints; ignores tails beyond Q1/Q3 \u2014 different estimator, different robustness profile, different quantity. C61=rolling MAD median(|x-median(x)|), L1 robust scale centered at the median using absolute deviations of ALL observations \u2014 C63 is mean pairwise distance, not median-centered deviation. C48=rolling STD (L2, mean-based 2nd-moment, outlier-sensitive). C56=CV=std/mean (relative L2 ratio). C49=kurtosis; C50=skewness (standardized higher moments). C57=Shannon value-bin entropy; C58=Bandt\u2013Pompe permutation entropy; C60=Sample Entropy template regularity (none are dispersion magnitude). C59=Hurst R/S fractal scaling exponent. C51=lag-1 autocorr. C52/C53/C55=cross-corrs; C54=OLS beta. C45=Amihud. C46=OBV signed-cumulative. C47=up/down imbalance. C43=unsloped divergence; C44=ROC. C23/40/41/42=vol_z level/expansion. None is a rolling Gini mean difference pairwise dispersion; C63 orthogonal to all transforms in C23/C40-C62.",
